  - Text:
      IsLocalized: 0
      Unlocalized: '<margin-left=16%><margin-right=2%><b>OFFICIALS PRAISE HERO RESPONSE</b>


        A
        spokesman credited the heroes with preventing further destruction. Residents
        interviewed by the Herald described buildings collapsing before any evacuation
        warning was given.


        Families seeking missing relatives are directed
        to the perimeter checkpoint.'
      Localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: 
