  - Text:
      IsLocalized: 0
      Unlocalized: "<margin-left=16%><margin-right=2%><b>DISTRICT REMAINS SEALED</b>\n\nPharmacies
        and local shops have been ordered to retain emergency supplies.\n\n<i>Written
        in the margin:</i>\n\"Storage lock changed. Use the toll on the front page.
        Digits only. \u2014 M.\""
